{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","彗星怒矢"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Comet Archery"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","射出彗星箭矢，对路径上的敌人造成伤害，在区域内的其他友军普通攻击会召唤流星造成一次额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Lyca fires a comet-like arrow, dealing damage to enemies in its path. Allies within range summon meteors with their normal attacks, dealing extra damage to the target."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向射出一支彗星箭矢，对箭矢沿途5格宽度内的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并留下一片“群星投影”，持续7秒，在“群星投影”内的其他友军使用普通攻击时，会同时召唤流星攻击目标，对其造成该友军50%攻击力的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lyca fires a comet-like arrow in a chosen direction, dealing 200% + 20% ATK damage to enemies within 5 tiles along its path and leaving Nebula Reflection for 7s. The allies under Nebula Reflection summon meteors to deal extra damage equal to 50% of their ATK to the target while using normal attacks."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 220% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 240% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 270% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","星辰祝福"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Empyrean Blessing"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","呼唤星辰提升全队攻击速度，首次释放额外回复能量。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Lyca bestows blessings of the stars on all allies, increasing their ATK SPD. She also grants them extra Energy on the first cast."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","星辰降下祝福，为所有友军提升25 + 5点攻击速度，持续6秒。战斗开始时会立即使用一次，额外使每名友军回复120点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lyca bestows blessings of the stars, increasing all allies' ATK SPD by 25 + 5 for 6s. This effect is triggered immediately when a battle starts and grants all allies 120 Energy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升幅度增加至30 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD to 30 + 5."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","持续时间提升至8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases effect duration to 8s."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击速度提升幅度增加至40 + 5点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD to 40 + 5."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","新星冲击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Nova Fall"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对全体敌人召唤流星攻击，降低其护甲。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Lyca summons meteors to attack all enemies, reducing their Phys DEF."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤流星，对全体敌人造成100% ATK伤害，在5 + 1.5秒内降低其-10%护甲。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lyca summons meteors to attack all enemies, dealing 100% ATK damage and reducing their Phys DEF by -10% for 5 + 1.5s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":109,"end":115,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 120% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护甲降低幅度提升至-12%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces their Phys DEF by -12%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至130% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 130% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 21 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 27 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升33点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 33 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","毁灭流星"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Meteor Catastrophe"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤流星协助自己攻击。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Lyca summons meteors to assist the battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，召唤流星围绕自身，每当自身普通攻击时，流星也会攻击目标，造成40% ATK的物理伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lyca summons meteors when a battle starts, directing them to attack targets with her normal attacks, dealing 40% ATK physical damage."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":109,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 50% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当场上敌人存在护盾时，流星会发射一枚陨石攻击该目标，造成350% ATK的伤害，若成功破坏护盾，则眩晕目标4秒。流星每10秒至多发射一枚陨石。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Shoots an aerolite at a shielded enemy, dealing 350% ATK damage. If the shield breaks, the target is stunned for 4s. Only 1 aerolite can be shot every 10s."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成450% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases aerolite damage to 450% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人额外降低护甲。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Lyca reduces the target's Phys DEF if they are hit by Comet Archery."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人在6秒内降低25%护甲。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lyca reduces the target's Phys DEF by 25% for 6s if they are hit by Comet Archery."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","额外获得300点初始能量。技能“彗星怒矢”留下的“群星投影”时间延长7秒，并且友军攻击召唤的流星会附带莱卡40% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Lyca gains 300 extra Initial Energy. She extends the duration of Nebula Reflection from her Comet Archery by 7s and makes each meteor summoned by allied attacks deal extra damage equal to 40% ATK of her ATK."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":188,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星辰之弦"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Starstring Bow"]]}